        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>历史试题</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 18px 24px 24px 24px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .corner {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n  }\n  .corner.tl { top: 6px; left: 4px; border-top: 3px solid #4a9c4a; border-left: 3px solid #4a9c4a; }\n  .corner.tl:after { content:\"\"; position:absolute; top:6px; left:6px; width:34px; height:34px; border-top:2px solid #4a9c4a; border-left:2px solid #4a9c4a; }\n  .corner.br { bottom: 6px; right: 4px; border-bottom: 3px solid #4a9c4a; border-right: 3px solid #4a9c4a; }\n  .corner.br:after { content:\"\"; position:absolute; bottom:6px; right:6px; width:34px; height:34px; border-bottom:2px solid #4a9c4a; border-right:2px solid #4a9c4a; }\n\n  .header, .footer {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .header { border-bottom: 1px solid #333; padding-bottom: 3px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .footer { border-top: 0; margin-top: 14px; }\n  .wx { color: #111; }\n  .wx b { color: #000; }\n\n  .content { padding-left: 12px; padding-right: 8px; }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px solid #666;\n    background: #e8e8e8;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .img-top {\n    width: 300px;\n    height: 46px;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 22px;\n  }\n\n  p.q {\n    margin: 3px 0 2px 0;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  p.q .body { }\n  .opts {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .opts .col {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 210px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  .opt-line { padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n  .ticket-grid {\n    width: 330px;\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 24px;\n  }\n  .ticket-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .ticket {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 58px;\n  }\n  .ticket .num {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 2px;\n    bottom: 1px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"corner tl\"></div>\n  <div class=\"corner br\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"header wx\">公众号：前途学科资料　客服微信：<b>yjhs92</b></div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder img-top\">[图片：历史场景版画，居于文首上方]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"opt-line\">A．秋收时节暮云愁，霹雳一声暴动</div>\n    <div class=\"opt-line\">B．钟山风雨起苍黄，百万雄师过大江</div>\n    <div class=\"opt-line\">C．红军不怕远征难，万水千山只等闲</div>\n    <div class=\"opt-line\">D．雄赳赳，气昂昂，跨过鸭绿江</div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">15．（2分）中国共产党历史上有一次重要会议是在与共产国际中断联系的情况下召开的，同时这次会议还是中国共产党历史上生死攸关的转折点。这次会议是（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\">A．中共二大</span><span class=\"col\">B．八七会议</span><br>\n      <span class=\"col\">C．遵义会议</span><span class=\"col\">D．中共七大</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">16．（2分）在武昌洪山修建的国民革命军第四军独立团官兵烈士墓中，安葬着191位革命士兵。墓碑上镌刻着\"精神不死\"\"先烈之血，主义之花\"字句。该材料反映的历史事件是（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\">A．武昌起义</span><span class=\"col\">B．黄花岗起义</span><br>\n      <span class=\"col\">C．北伐战争</span><span class=\"col\">D．武汉会战</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">17．（2分）抗日战争爆发后，对国共两党合作抗日起到重要作用的事件是（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\">A．九一八事变</span><span class=\"col\">B．西安事变和平解决</span><br>\n      <span class=\"col\">C．八一三事变</span><span class=\"col\">D．黄埔军校建立</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">18．（2分）2014年2月27日，十二届全国人大常委会通过决定，将每年的12月13日设立为国家公祭日。其公祭的对象是（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\">A．国民大革命死难者</span><span class=\"col\">B．抗日战争死难者</span><br>\n      <span class=\"col\">C．南京大屠杀死难者</span><span class=\"col\">D．解放战争死难者</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">19．（2分）毛泽东指出《双十协定》\"第一个好处是采取平等的方式，双方正式签订协定，这是历史上未有过的。\"与此协定签署相关的事件是（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\">A．国民党一大</span><span class=\"col\">B．西安事变</span><br>\n      <span class=\"col\">C．抗战胜利</span><span class=\"col\">D．重庆谈判</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">20．（2分）一位学生在综合实践活动中，收集了四处纪念馆的参观券。按其纪念的历史事件发生的先后顺序排列，正确的是（　　）</p>\n\n    <div class=\"ticket-grid\">\n      <div class=\"ticket-row\">\n        <div class=\"ticket placeholder\">[参观券图片：国民革命军北伐战争史陈列馆　参观券]<span class=\"num\">①</span></div>\n        <div class=\"ticket placeholder\">[参观券图片：辽沈战役纪念馆　参观券]<span class=\"num\">②</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ticket-row\">\n        <div class=\"ticket placeholder\">[参观券图片：中国人民抗日战争纪念馆　参观券]<span class=\"num\">③</span></div>\n        <div class=\"ticket placeholder\">[参观券图片：井冈山革命博物馆　参观券]<span class=\"num\">④</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">A．①②④③</span><span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">B．①④③②</span><span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">C．③②①④</span><span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">D．④①②③</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">21．（2分）北平是一座历史文化名城，在它的中心，历史遗迹在解放战争中得以完整保存下来，主要得益于（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\">A．北平和议</span><span class=\"col\">B．北平和平解放</span><br>\n      <span class=\"col\">C．南京解放</span><span class=\"col\">D．开国大典</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">22．（2分）1949年，毛泽东向全世界宣告中华人民共和国成立的那一天是（　　）</p>\n    <div class=\"opts\">\n      <span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">A．1月1日</span><span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">B．7月1日</span><span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">C．8月1日</span><span class=\"col\" style=\"width:105px\">D．10月1日</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"q\">23．（2分）某历史学习小组围绕西藏和平解放、土地改革、抗美援朝进行研究</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer wx\" style=\"text-align:left; padding-left:12px;\">公众号：前途学科资料　客服微信：<b>yjhs92</b></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
